{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:bd4b6e76d9733c5d","name":"Elite Soldier Squad","source":{"id":"source:reference-bd4b6e76d9733c5d","title":"Elite Soldier Squad","revision":22233,"timestamp":"2024-09-01T14:09:15Z","sha256":"beafa67612d40335aa8728db27d3a024f1b35d53ef4aa5094f784bbee81997c7","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=22233","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Elite%20Soldier%20Squad&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-bd4b6e76d9733c5d","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Books: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Threats of the Galaxy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Threats_of_the_Galaxy"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Clone Wars Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Elite Soldiers are some of the best and deadliest warriors that an army, mercenary force, or planetary guard has to offer. Taught to master the essentials of combat and basic soldiering, Elite Soldiers receive special, highly intensive training to specialize in particular ways of killing. Because of the time and cost involved in training such troops, they are used sparingly for specific missions in which their skills can utterly dominate the enemy. \n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Elite Soldiers are often put together in small units of talented individuals- such units are almost equal in capability to a full platoon or even a company of regular troopers. Other Elite Soldiers are placed in command of normal troops, leading by example and bolstering their firepower and usefulness on the battlefield. Certain Elite Soldiers serve as bodyguards for high-ranking officials or characters, who might be quite powerful in their own regard. Wherever there is conflict in the universe, Elite Soldier are on hand, doing the dirty work that few others are capable of handling. \n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Elite Soldier Encounters"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Elite Soldiers can be found in nearly any dangerous situation, where they serve the will of their superiors. Their duty could include serving on traditional battlefields, protecting sensitive areas, or engaging in clandestine operations. As befitting their status, Elite Soldiers are equipped with the best armor, weapons, and gear that their superiors have to offer, including cutting-edge technology not readily available to regular troops.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Elite Soldiers are commonly teamed with ",{"tag":"a","children":["Commandos"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Commandos"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Soldiers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Soldiers_(CL_2)"},", and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Soldier Commanders"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Soldier_Commanders"},", forming the vanguard of armies or leading assault forces where surgical precision is called for. Some Elite Soldiers form the equivalent of \"terror squads,\" meant to inflict as much damage in as grandiose a way as possible in order to send a political message or to break down the will of the enemy. These Elite Soldiers specialize in heavy weaponry, demolitions, and psychological techniques that maximize the impact of their actions.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Elite Soldier"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Elite_Soldier","referenceId":"reference:4937c2ed96b9fdad"}," Squad Statistics (CL 12)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Large (",{"tag":"a","children":["Squad"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Squad"},") ",{"tag":"a","children":["Soldier"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Soldier","referenceId":"reference:f826baa05bef6921"}," 7/",{"tag":"a","children":["Elite Trooper"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Elite_Trooper","referenceId":"reference:02fa86cb25e21540"}," 3\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Force Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force